---
import { extensionMarkPath, extensionMarkViewBox } from "../lib/extensionMark";
---
<figure class="builder-art" role="img" aria-label="Your source files become a bundled workspace tool in Tabs. React or plain HTML, packaged with a manifest and scoped access.">
  <div aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="art-handnote">From a few files to your own little world. <span>↘</span></p>
    <div class="builder-files"><span>src/</span><span>tabs-extension.json</span><span>README.md</span></div>
    <div class="builder-editor">
      <div class="builder-editor-bar"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Your idea / src/main.tsx</span></div>
      <div class="builder-source"><span class="source-line"><i>01</i><span><b>function</b> MyTool() {"{"}</span></span><span class="source-line"><i>02</i><span>&nbsp; <b>return</b> (</span></span><span class="source-line"><i>03</i><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;<b>main</b>&gt;</span></span><span class="source-line"><i>04</i><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Your next good idea.</span></span><span class="source-line"><i>05</i><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;/<b>main</b>&gt;</span></span><span class="source-line"><i>06</i><span>&nbsp; );</span></span><span class="source-line"><i>07</i><span>{"}"}</span></span></div>
      <div class="builder-editor-foot"><span>React or plain HTML</span><span>→ .tabs-extension/</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="builder-bridge"><span>Build it.</span><svg width="80" height="40" viewBox="0 0 80 40" fill="none"><path d="M3 6c36-4 39 30 71 23m-9-6 10 6-8 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Make room for it.</span></div>
    <div class="builder-output"><div class="builder-output-bar"><span>Tabs / Your project</span><span class="builder-output-tool"><svg viewBox={extensionMarkViewBox} fill="currentColor"><path d={extensionMarkPath} fill-rule="evenodd" /></svg>My tool</span></div><div class="builder-output-space"><span>✳</span><div><small>YOUR OWN WORKSPACE TOOL</small><strong>Your next<br /><em>good idea.</em></strong></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Illustrative source and workspace. Start with the downloadable templates.</figcaption>
</figure>
